# UNDERDELVE: the Gloom wanders one room at a time as Mo moves between rooms.
# When it finds him it rises in the middle of the room, faster than he is,
# and if it touches him every lantern goes out at once.
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 5
cheat room 1 5 30 130
cheat clear_enemies
cheat gloom_at 4 4
cheat room 2 5 30 130
cheat clear_enemies
expect gloom_y >= 3
cheat gloom
wait 25
expect gloom_here == 1
expect lanterns == 6
wait 200
expect state >= 2
wait 80
expect state == 3
